  "content": "<p>本模组是Vazkii创作的\"药水戒指\"的移植版本</p><p>原版模组：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/potion-fingers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/potion-fingers</a></p><p>寻找Forge/NeoForge版本？请访问<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/potion-ring-reforged\" rel=\"nofollow\">这里</a></p><p>我非常喜欢这个模组，但很遗憾它没有更新到新版Minecraft，所以我重制了这个版本。</p><p>本Fabric版本需要依赖<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trinkets-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Trinkets</a>模组。</p>\n\n<p><strong>戒指展示</strong><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1135/301/2025-03-23_15.png\"></p>\n\n<p><strong>双重效果</strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1135/334/2025-03-23_15.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1135/335/2025-03-23_15.png\"></p>\n\n<p><strong>合成配方</strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1135/302/2025-03-23_15.png\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1135/303/2025-03-23_15.png\"></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1135/304/2025-03-23_15.png\"></p>\n\n<p><strong>自定义戒指</strong></p>\n<p>在药水戒指重铸2.0中，你可以创建带有模组效果的定制戒指。</p>\n<p>查看Wiki了解如何制作：<a href=\"https://github.com/Samlegamer/PotionRingReforged/wiki/How-to-create-a-custom-ring\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/Samlegamer/PotionRingReforged/wiki/How-to-create-a-custom-ring</a><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1135/326/2025-03-15_14.png\"></p>\n\n<p><strong>兼容性整合<em> - 与</em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/size-shifting-potions\" rel=\"nofollow\">尺寸变化药水</a>模组</strong><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1135/292/2025-03-23_15-27-54-png.png\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Trinkets (Fabric版)</strong></span>：<a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trinkets-fabric&amp;nbsp;</a></p>",
